   - Call `activity_class.getClassLoader()` → `java/lang/ClassLoader` (system method, no lookup needed).
   - Call `classLoader.loadClass("com.kal.calendar.KalFilePicker")` → returns the app class.

   Actually — `env.call_method` on a JObject just needs the method name + signature; JNI resolves method IDs by name/signature on the actual runtime class, no FindClass required. So this works entirely without `find_class`.

