**Simpler plan**:
1. **Fix the freeze** (clear, safe): make "Sync now" run `run_sync_once` on a background thread and post the result back to the UI via signals. Show "Syncing…".
2. **Fix the no-sync** (targeted): add a periodic background auto-sync effect in main.rs that runs a live round every N seconds when paired. This gives automatic convergence.

